# Generated run artefacts. Everything under results/ is reproducible from
# `make eval`, so it is not tracked, with one exception: results/reference/
# holds the compact summary of the recorded simulated runs that the README
# quotes, and CI checks the README against it (tests/test_results_reference.py).
results/*
!results/reference/
*.bag
*.db3
*.mcap
rosbag2_*/

# Maps produced by `make map`. The reference map that the demo localises
# against is tracked (simulation/maps/warehouse.*); scratch maps are not.
maps_scratch/

# Gazebo
.gazebo/
*.log

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
